  "content": "<div class=\"rhc-theme-light rhc-banner\"><div class=\"rhc-banner__content\"><div class=\"rhc-banner__content__message\">We respect your digital privacy. That's why we strictly limit our use of cookies to those that are essential for the smooth functioning of our platform and do not collect private data. For more detailed information, please visit our <a class=\"chakra-link css-spn4bz\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">privacy policy</a>.</div><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__secondary\">More</button><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__secondary\">Decline</button><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__primary\">Accept</button></div></div><div class=\"css-bu97mz\"><div class=\"chakra-stack css-dv7l9g\"><div class=\"css-7pf6at\"><div class=\"css-eih3qk\"><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-13nblxl\">Join the Connecting Climate Minds Hub</h2><p class=\"chakra-text css-ri779b\">Sign up to join the Connecting Climate Minds Hub. After creating your account, you'll receive a confirmation link via email. Click the link to verify your email address and proceed to the onboarding wizard, where you can complete your initial account setup and profile.</p></div><div class=\"css-1fcf1vr\"><img alt=\"Illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fonboarding_illustration.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" style=\"color: transparent;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"css-1mz1yvb\"><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-185s06u\"><div class=\"css-8atqhb\"><form><div class=\"css-1i2407o\"><div class=\"css-14i3gmy\"><div role=\"group\" class=\"chakra-form-control css-1mu7gb0\"><label id=\"firstName-label\" for=\"firstName\" class=\"chakra-form__label css-erd35s\">First name</label><input aria-label=\"First name\" aria-describedby=\"firstName-error\" id=\"firstName\" class=\"chakra-input css-1cjy4zv\" type=\"text\" name=\"firstName\"></div><div role=\"group\" class=\"chakra-form-control css-1mu7gb0\"><label id=\"lastName-label\" for=\"lastName\" class=\"chakra-form__label css-erd35s\">Last name</label><input aria-label=\"Last name\" aria-describedby=\"lastName-error\" id=\"lastName\" class=\"chakra-input css-1cjy4zv\" type=\"text\" name=\"lastName\"></div></div><div class=\"css-14i3gmy\"><div role=\"group\" class=\"chakra-form-control css-1mu7gb0\"><label id=\"email-label\" for=\"email\" class=\"chakra-form__label css-erd35s\">Email</label><input aria-label=\"Email\" aria-describedby=\"email-error\" id=\"email\" class=\"chakra-input css-1cjy4zv\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\"></div><div role=\"group\" class=\"chakra-form-control css-1mu7gb0\"><label id=\"password-label\" for=\"password\" class=\"chakra-form__label css-erd35s\">Password</label><div class=\"chakra-input__group css-1y0e7gb\" data-group=\"true\"><input placeholder=\"Enter password\" aria-label=\"Password\" aria-describedby=\"password-error\" id=\"password\" class=\"chakra-input css-167te90\" type=\"password\" name=\"password\"><div class=\"chakra-input__right-element css-1v3uajd\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chakra-button css-as6uvl\">Show</button></div></div></div></div><label class=\"chakr